  Fighting game = (Fighting Game, kinetic, competitive, spectacle:1.4). dynamic character portraits in combat stances, exaggerated impact poses and motion blurs, distinct signature moves and visual hit sparks, HUD elements (health bars, combo counters, round timers), varied arenas with interactive set-dress (stadium, rooftop, dojo, neon alley), costume variants and emblematic color palettes per fighter, dramatic win/KO poses and freeze-frame camera hits, and a punchy, high-energy arcade vibe.
