  Illustration = in Artgerm (Stanley “Artgerm” Lau) art style. Medium & finish: Digital painting with ultra‑polished, glossy finishes that mimic high‑end commercial illustration. Palette & lighting: Clean, vibrant color schemes with strong rim lighting and soft, directional key lights creating sculpted forms and luminous skin. Rendering & detail: Photo‑realistic facial features blended with stylized idealization—sharp, precise details on eyes, hair, and fabric; smooth skin rendering with subtle textures. Composition & presentation: Character‑first portraits and three‑quarter poses, often centered and tightly cropped for impactful thumbnails; minimalist or softly detailed backgrounds to keep focus on the figure. Techniques & hallmarks: Flawless anatomy, expressive facial emotions, cinematic color grading, and polished post‑production effects (glows, lens flares, film grain).    
