  Cute Cartoon 3 = Soft, stylized digital cartoon with clear influence from Western webcomic and modern animation aesthetics. Color palette: pastel, high-key hues producing a soft, romantic mood; flat color fields with limited shading. Linework: clean, smooth vector-like outlines of medium thickness; lines vary slightly for emphasis (thicker at outer contours, thinner on inner details). Shapes & anatomy: simplified, rounded forms with proportionally large heads and eyes; features are exaggerated for expression. Shading & lighting: minimal cel-shading — subtle gradients or single-tone shadows mainly to suggest volume (cheeks blushed with soft saturated tones); highlights are sparse or omitted. Texture & detail: minimal texture, smooth flat surfaces; small stylistic details (sparkles, blush marks, simple hair shapes) add charm without clutter. Stylistic lineage: borrows from indie webcomic art and contemporary character design used in animated shorts — approachable, expressive, and optimized for emotive storytelling.
